        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of roughly 850 km is covered in 12‑16 hours of driving time, depending on traffic and weather. Our dedicated multi‑axle trucks operate on National Highway corridors with scheduled rest stops, so most residential moves are completed within a single business day, plus loading and unloading time.</p>
