        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that safeguards the full declared value of your items. The policy includes coverage for loss, theft, and damage caused by road incidents, and a claim can be processed within 48 hours using the digital documentation we provide.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I transport my two‑wheelers safely on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Our dedicated two‑wheeler carriers feature hydraulic loading ramps, anti‑slip wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Each bike or scooter is secured inside an enclosed trailer with live GPS tracking, ensuring zero exposure to road debris and climate while maintaining full insurance coverage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost calculated for a full‑house move from Dumka to Isri Bazar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on the volume of packed goods (measured in cubic feet), distance, type of vehicle required, and any special handling such as fragile or heavy items. A transparent tariff sheet includes base freight, fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and optional services like carpentry or assembly, with no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any items that cannot be moved on the Dumka‑Isri Bazar corridor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, hazardous materials (flammable liquids, chemicals, explosives), perishable food items without refrigeration, and live animals are prohibited. Additionally, items that exceed the weight limits of our container trucks (over 30 tons per vehicle) must be arranged as separate freight. Our pre‑move audit will flag any restricted goods.</p>
