      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the GPS tracking system keep me updated during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each container truck is equipped with satellite‑based GPS that streams live location data to our client portal. Customers receive real‑time alerts at key milestones—departure, en‑route checkpoints, and arrival. The system also logs temperature and vibration metrics for sensitive shipments, ensuring complete visibility from Dumka to Isri Bazar.</p>
